{"path":"io/basic_ios/rdstate","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::rdstate","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>rdstate","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/rdstate","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the current stream error state.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iostate rdstate<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the current stream error state.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>current stream error state. It is a bitmask type and can be a combination of the following constants:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Constant\n</td>\n<td> Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>goodbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> no error\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>badbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> irrecoverable stream error\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>failbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> input/output operation failed (formatting or extraction error)\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><code>eofbit</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> associated input sequence has reached end-of-file\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> stream<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>stream.<span class=\"me1\">rdstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1715\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">goodbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"stream state is goodbit<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    stream.<span class=\"me1\">setstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1718\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eofbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// check state is exactly eofbit (no failbit and no badbit)</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>stream.<span class=\"me1\">rdstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/iostate\"><span class=\"kw1718\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">eofbit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"stream state is eofbit<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>stream state is goodbit\nstream state is eofbit</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/setstate\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setstate</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets state flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/clear\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clear</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  modifies state flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::rdstate","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the current stream error state."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"current stream error state. It is a bitmask type and can be a combination of the following constants:","children":[{"label":"goodbit","note":"no error"},{"label":"badbit","note":"irrecoverable stream error"},{"label":"failbit","note":"input/output operation failed (formatting or extraction error)"},{"label":"eofbit","note":"associated input sequence has reached end-of-file"}]},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"setstate","note":"sets state flags"},{"label":"clear","note":"modifies state flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":123,"codeBlockCount":2}
